@startuml
title 9.8.6 Training Round Command Creation\nand Global Model Distribution

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    DividerBorderColor #777777
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerFontStyle bold
    GroupBorderColor #777777
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    NoteBorderColor #777777
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDF5
}

legend top left
  X = 1..N (factory index)

  CIN : contentInstance

  Mca : AE-CSE reference point
  Mcc : CSE-CSE reference point
endlegend

box "Factory X" #EAF2FC
participant "MN-AE-X" as MNAE
participant "MN-CSE-X" as MNCSE
end box

box "Cloud Service Platform" #FFF8E7
participant "IN-CSE" as INCSE
participant "IN-AE" as INAE
end box


== Training Round Command Creation ==

INAE -> INCSE : 1. CREATE round-command <CIN>\nunder cnt-fl-control
INCSE --> INAE : 2. CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED


== Cross-CSE Round Command Notification ==

loop for each factory X = 1..N
    INCSE -> MNCSE : 3. NOTIFY round command\nTo: MN-AE-X
    MNCSE -> MNAE : 4. Forward NOTIFY via Mca
    MNAE --> MNCSE : 5. NOTIFY Response\n2000 OK
    MNCSE --> INCSE : 6. Forward NOTIFY Response
end


== Global Model Metadata Retrieval ==

loop for each factory X = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNCSE : 7. RETRIEVE global model metadata
    MNCSE -> INCSE : 8. Forward RETRIEVE via Mcc
    INCSE --> MNCSE : 9. RETRIEVE Response
    MNCSE --> MNAE : 10. Forward RETRIEVE Response
end


== Global Model Download and Local Cache ==

loop for each factory X = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNAE : 11. Download and verify\nglobal model
    MNAE -> MNCSE : 12. CREATE cached-model <CIN>\nunder cnt-local-model
    MNCSE --> MNAE : 13. CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED
end

@enduml